  - english: A trap holds a monster for four seconds, then needs time to reset.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EABy gi\u1EEF qu\xE1i b\u1ED1n gi\xE2y, sau \u0111\xF3 c\u1EA7n
      th\u1EDDi gian h\u1ED3i."
  - english: Bushes can hide you, but nearby monsters can still find you.
    vietnamese: "C\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u1EA9n trong b\u1EE5i c\xE2y, nh\u01B0ng qu\xE1i
      \u0111\u1EE9ng qu\xE1 g\u1EA7n v\u1EABn ph\xE1t hi\u1EC7n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c."
